{%- layout none -%}
{%- comment -%}
  llms.txt — a plain-text map of the shop for AI assistants (llmstxt.org).

  Shopify themes cannot place a file at the site root, so this is a page
  template. To publish it:
    1  Online Store → Pages → Add page, title "llms", template "page.llms".
    2  Online Store → Navigation → URL redirects: /llms.txt → /pages/llms

  Everything below is generated from the shop's own data, so it stays up
  to date as products and collections change. The page's own content, if
  the merchant writes any, is added as an "About" section.
{%- endcomment -%}
# {{ shop.name }}

> {% if shop.description != blank %}{{ shop.description | strip_html | strip_newlines }}{% else %}{{ shop.name }} sells handcrafted sofas, corner sofas, sofa beds and armchairs, made to order and delivered across the United Kingdom.{% endif %}

Website: {{ request.origin }}
{%- if shop.email != blank %}
Contact: {{ shop.email }}
{%- endif %}
Currency: {{ shop.currency }}
{%- if page.content != blank %}

## About

{{ page.content | strip_html | strip }}
{%- endif %}

## Collections
{% for c in collections limit: 50 %}
{%- if c.products_count > 0 %}
- [{{ c.title }}]({{ request.origin }}{{ c.url }}){% if c.description != blank %}: {{ c.description | strip_html | strip_newlines | truncate: 160 }}{% endif %}
{%- endif %}
{%- endfor %}

## Products
{% paginate collections.all.products by 250 %}
{%- for p in collections.all.products %}
- [{{ p.title }}]({{ request.origin }}{{ p.url }}): {{ p.price | money_without_currency | strip_html }} {{ shop.currency }}{% unless p.available %} (sold out){% endunless %}{% assign d = p.description | strip_html | strip_newlines | strip %}{% if d != blank %}. {{ d | truncate: 180 }}{% endif %}
{%- endfor %}
{% endpaginate %}

## Information
{%- assign info_handles = 'about,about-us,contact,delivery,faq,showroom,care' | split: ',' %}
{%- for handle in info_handles %}
{%- assign info_page = pages[handle] %}
{%- if info_page != blank and info_page.url != blank %}
- [{{ info_page.title }}]({{ request.origin }}{{ info_page.url }})
{%- endif %}
{%- endfor %}
{%- for policy in shop.policies %}
- [{{ policy.title }}]({{ request.origin }}{{ policy.url }})
{%- endfor %}

## Optional

- [Search]({{ request.origin }}{{ routes.search_url }}?q=sofa)
- [Sitemap]({{ request.origin }}/sitemap.xml)
